["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"How Deep Learning Finally Cracked Messy Tables - Frank Hutter in-context learning posterior predictive distribution do-calculus structural causal model ELO score\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-mlst-深度学习靠合成数据训练-终于打赢了表格数据里的xgboost/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/166bfadd1a24fa05-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:53:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ML Street Talk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>深度学习靠合成数据训练，终于打赢了表格数据里的XGBoost</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">能找到的真实表格数据集只有约5万个，不足以喂饱深度网络；PriorLabs转而用因果结构模型批量合成训练数据，让TabPFN第一次在表格预测上稳定超过XGBoost和CatBoost。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">表格数据</span><span class=\"tag\">基础模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"🔬Bio-security is an AI Arms Race - Eric Nguyen (CEO, Radical Numerics) GLM (Genome Language Model) HyenaDNA Evo Omni biodefense sequence matching\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-latentspace-ai-能造出病毒了-防御方还停在序列比对/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1e6493311dc717df-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>AI 能造出病毒了，防御方还停在序列比对</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">生成致病序列的模型和判别序列是否致病的模型本质上是同一批模型，所以做设计的团队最适合做防御——但防御侧现在远远落后，基线还停在序列比对。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生物安全</span><span class=\"tag\">基因组模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Robert Moses and the Shaping of New York, Part 2 Title I slum clearance Power Broker King Features Syndicate\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-stuffmissed-他修的路拆了谁的房-罗伯特-摩西的纽约遗产/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">42:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>他修的路拆了谁的房：罗伯特·摩西的纽约遗产</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">摩西用联邦 Title I 资金拆掉26个街区，把穷人从贫民窟赶到另一个贫民窟，却宣称98%的搬迁者住得更好——他的遗产至今无人能定论。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">城市更新</span><span class=\"tag\">基础设施</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Auto Research on Yukon with Soubhik Deb Q-day Johnson bound proximity gap NSD ping-pong MLX Dark Bloom\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-zeroknowledge-google-藏起来的量子方案-被一群业余研究者反超了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7dca63fe71cd70d3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Z\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Zero Knowledge</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>Google 藏起来的量子方案，被一群业余研究者反超了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Google 用零知识证明证明自己找到了更省资源的量子破解方案，却不公开电路。Yukon 把这个问题变成开放竞赛，让 agent 在别人的提交上继续跑，最终反超 Google 结果 60% 以上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动研究</span><span class=\"tag\">零知识证明</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"What Lyse Doucet Has Learned from 40 Years Reporting From War Zones, Live war of choice chadili agency madrasa\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-iq2-信息从未如此充裕-我们却选择不知道/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/30946a55a23131db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Intelligence Squared</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>信息从未如此充裕，我们却选择不知道</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Lyse Doucet 做了四十年战地报道，她的判断是：不知道不是因为信息不够，而是因为不想知道。而这场伊朗战争是一场选择之战，它让一切变得更糟。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">战地报道</span><span class=\"tag\">伊朗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Shashank Joshi on Why Russia Won&#x27;t Invade NATO—Yet Article V hybrid warfare Bab-el-Mandeb East-West pipeline\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-goodfight-俄罗斯不会入侵北约-但正在测试它会不会散架/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>俄罗斯不会入侵北约，但正在测试它会不会散架</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">俄罗斯没有能力发动地面进攻，它的真正目标是腐蚀北约的政治凝聚力——用无人机、包裹炸弹和模糊地带，逼美国在危机中暴露分歧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地缘政治</span><span class=\"tag\">北约</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Amjad Masad on Rethinking College for the AI Era premature optimization Holacracy self-driving company vibe research virtue ethics\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-a16z-年轻人对社会的用处是当异端-不是当好公民/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">47:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>年轻人对社会的用处是当异端，不是当好公民</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大学把年轻人训练成好公民，但社会真正需要的是他们质疑所有人习以为常的东西；AI 时代每个学生都能自己动手做项目，缺的只是被允许。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育</span><span class=\"tag\">创业时机</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Jensen Huang Thinks A.I. Alarmism Has Gone Too Far inference time scaling retrieval based computing containment agent harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-ezra-黄仁勋-说-ai-有-10-概率毁灭人类是不负责任的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a8482192037a6711-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:47:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Ezra Klein Show</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋：说 AI 有 10% 概率毁灭人类是不负责任的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他承认 AI 会改变每一份工作，但把失控风险当成可解的工程问题：如果实验室真相信自己失控了，正确答案就是别发布产品，而不是一边买最多算力一边请求被减速。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>14</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 监管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Has the UK’s productivity puzzle been solved? ONS productivity puzzle leaving certificate loudness wars\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-moreorless-英国生产率危机是统计错误-0-7-被改成-1-3/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/475b54e7ecf452a3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">29:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">More or Less</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>英国生产率危机是统计错误：0.7% 被改成 1.3%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英国被当成发达国家生产率最差生的十五年，可能只是 ONS 算错了工时——把度假的人按 40 小时算进去，分母虚高，生产率被压低。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英国经济</span><span class=\"tag\">生产率</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Why are used cars priced like new cars? price waterfall APR MSRP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-indicator-二手车为什么卖出了新车的价格/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">9:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Indicator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>二手车为什么卖出了新车的价格</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">新车涨价会通过「价格瀑布」把二手车一起拖上去，疫情减产让车市像蛇吞老鼠一样消化了好几年，而美国车企干脆停产了便宜轿车——10 到 15 千美元能买到的车，车龄从 5 年变成了 9 年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽车市场</span><span class=\"tag\">通胀</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Is our national debt finally too much? (update) deficit hawk / deficit dove crowding out debt to GDP ratio Treasury bonds\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-planetmoney-美国债务破-40-万亿-连鸽派都改口当鹰派了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">29:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Planet Money</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>美国债务破 40 万亿：连鸽派都改口当鹰派了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2010 年那篇说债务超 GDP 90% 增长就减半的论文，被政客当成红线用了十几年；如今连当年主张大胆花钱的鸽派经济学家都改口自称鹰派，但没人能说出那条线在哪。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宏观经济</span><span class=\"tag\">美国国债</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Hidden Recession Beneath The AI Bubble w/ Paul Kedrosky balance sheet recession Minsky moment AMT hurdle rate EBBT token maxing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-betteroffline-ai-债务正在和美元抢钱-美国经济其实在通缩/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fd2855e350ec8287-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">54:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Better Offline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>AI 债务正在和美元抢钱，美国经济其实在通缩</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 资本开支已经大到挤进美债市场、扭曲全球贸易和通胀数据；把 AI 相关部分剔掉，美国经济其实是轻微通缩，而美联储正在照着错误的原因加息。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 资本开支</span><span class=\"tag\">美债</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Steve Hilton &amp; Spencer Pratt: Fixing California, Cheaper Gas, Ballot Fraud &amp; CA Republicans ballot harvesting resource curse cap and invest low carbon fuel standard mass tort\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-allin-硅谷太赚钱-反而让加州政府没有变好的动力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/31e8abb9605670fc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">55:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>硅谷太赚钱，反而让加州政府没有变好的动力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">加州一党独大 16 年，不是因为选民想要大政府，而是硅谷上缴的税收太丰厚，政府不需要靠政绩生存。州长候选人 Steve Hilton 说，代价是贫穷率、失业率和生活成本全美最高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国政治</span><span class=\"tag\">加州</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"89.当 AI 进入组织，那些「从没人说过的真相」｜与网易阮良聊 AI 原生组织与企业 Agent 实战 Vibe Coding Agent Skills OPC 鲁棒性\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-lightstar-个人提效三倍-公司交付只从20天缩到17天/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1386f347b8716dd0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"卫\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">漫谈Light the Star</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>个人提效三倍，公司交付只从20天缩到17天</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI武装了每个人，组织却没变快——因为木桶的短板不是人，是流程。真正的分水岭是能不能改造流程和组织，而不是给员工发token。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI原生组织</span><span class=\"tag\">企业Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"240. 月饼一年只卖两个月，为什么还能做成282亿的生意？ GB19855 mini package OEM 桃山皮\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-beiwanglu-月饼一年只卖两个月-却做成了282亿的生意/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c56ff7e702000290-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"贝\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">贝望录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>月饼一年只卖两个月，却做成了282亿的生意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">月饼被中秋绑定后反而困住了销售期，但282亿的规模靠的是送礼场景和柔性定制产线，不是靠口味创新。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">食品行业</span><span class=\"tag\">消费</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"🔬 An Oscar, Two Asteroids, and the Algorithm in Your sklearn: John Platt on AI for Science ERA Monte Carlo Tree Search upper confidence bound contrail NISQ broom sensor\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-22-latentspace-ai-做科学卡在最后-0-001-分-不是卡在算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3960561d47aff299-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">2:01:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>AI 做科学卡在最后 0.001 分，不是卡在算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">ERA 能跑出成千上万个候选 notebook，却关不上最后 30 名的差距——因为内层是机器，外层还得靠人判断「这篇论文你搞错了」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI for science</span><span class=\"tag\">气候建模</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Julian Gewirtz on Trump-Xi Summit, AI, and Mao Dead Fifty Years Ago! K-shaped open weight models Memcon peak China\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-22-chinatalk-特朗普请习近平看戏-美国换到了什么实质东西/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d08a480527461540-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>特朗普请习近平看戏，美国换到了什么实质东西</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这场国事访问几乎没有实质议程，纯粹是象征与镜头。问题不是会不会出岔子，而是美国拿象征换到了什么实质——目前看，什么都没换。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美关系</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 监管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Inside Canada&#x27;s EU Courtship associate member Erasmus NAFTA price discovery\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-22-wsjournal-加拿大想加入欧盟-这是对美国的永久分手-不是等特朗普下台/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fc66680f65b8e859-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">25:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Journal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>加拿大想加入欧盟：这是对美国的永久分手，不是等特朗普下台</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">加拿大要当欧盟第一个「准成员」，但欧盟根本没有这个身份。这是一次押注欧洲、疏远美国的世代级转向，而欧洲经济增速只有美国的一半。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地缘经济</span><span class=\"tag\">加拿大</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Episode 341: Psychology Ranked (With Paul Bloom) replication crisis false belief task theory of mind social priming precognition construct\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-22-verybad-心理学经典实验排等级-很多结论撑不过复现/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/de9fabd2316045b0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"V\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Very Bad Wizards</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>心理学经典实验排等级，很多结论撑不过复现</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">米尔格拉姆电击实验还能复现，这本身就够离谱；而好撒玛利亚人实验总共只有 40 个受试者，就算他们对了也是碰巧对的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心理学</span><span class=\"tag\">复现危机</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Inside the &#x27;modern slavery&#x27; where cyber scammers are victims themselves pig butchering Tether Volt Typhoon industrial control systems\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-22-freshair-杀猪盘里没有赢家-骗人的人也是被贩卖的奴隶/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac302fa97b80aab2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">46:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Fresh Air</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>杀猪盘里没有赢家：骗人的人也是被贩卖的奴隶</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">东南亚诈骗园区里，被没收护照、按业绩罚款的「员工」每天用 ChatGPT 和 DeepSeek 写情话，骗走受害者的全部积蓄——这是史上最赚钱的网络犯罪，受害者站在两边。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">网络诈骗</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 滥用</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Carlo Rovelli: Free Will Is Real. Physics Can Prove It. coarse graining loop quantum gravity relational quantum mechanics Josephson junction equivalence principle\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-22-intotheimpossi-熵增不等于变乱-油水分层-霜花结晶都是自发的秩序/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dfac8bb59ae9df0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Into the Impossible With Brian Keating</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>熵增不等于变乱：油水分层、霜花结晶都是自发的秩序</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">热力学第二定律常被讲成「东西会越来越乱」，但油水分离、沙滩分选、窗上霜花都是自发有序。Carlo Rovelli 说，低熵也许不在宇宙，而在我们看宇宙的方式。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子引力</span><span class=\"tag\">熵与时间</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Debating RSI, the US-China Gap, and Jaggedness with JS Denain of Epoch AI RSI ECI distillation four-minute mile effect jaggedness Goodharted\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-22-interconnects-中美ai差距只有六到八个月-全面封杀蒸馏也拖不了太多/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/911e237a65028ea0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>中美AI差距只有六到八个月：全面封杀蒸馏也拖不了太多</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Epoch AI研究员JS Denain认为中美顶尖模型差距只有六到八个月，即便彻底禁掉蒸馏，六个月后差距也只会从六个月扩大到八九个月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">RSI</span><span class=\"tag\">中美AI差距</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Blake Scholl: Why Plane Speed Stalled, Supersonic Commercial Flight, &amp; Revolutionizing the Engine boomless cruise Mach cutoff behind the meter return on net assets\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-22-allin-超音速客机没落五十年-卡在发动机不在空气动力学/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/27508ce5ab7e7d59-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">17:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>超音速客机没落五十年，卡在发动机不在空气动力学</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">协和式被禁不是因为技术不行，是音爆砸到地面；Boom 用大气折射把音爆拐上天，禁令就没了。真正卡住超音速半个世纪的是发动机，而它现在先拿去给数据中心发电。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">超音速</span><span class=\"tag\">航空</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Rebranding in a war zone, with Prosper Global (formerly Mercy Corps) From Hormuz to Hunger Gaza Sky Geeks USAID\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-22-masterscale-慈善机构改名-为什么比企业改名更危险/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a46e1455d559a76a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">26:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters of Scale</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>慈善机构改名，为什么比企业改名更危险</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Mercy Corps 改名 Prosper Global，不是因为战略变了，而是旧名字装不下它已经在做的事——但改名在冲突地区可能让员工更危险。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人道援助</span><span class=\"tag\">品牌重塑</span>\n</div></div></a>"]